cmu-wendigo-lab-first-meal = The meat tastes... right.
cmu-wendigo-lab-fed-again = The gnawing in your gut grows sharper.
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutagen = A cold, crawling heat spreads through your veins.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-start = Something inside you wakes up.
cmu-wendigo-lab-aborted = The gnawing hunger fades.
cmu-wendigo-lab-not-ready = Your body rejects it. It feels wrong.
cmu-wendigo-lab-dose-too-small = Your veins tingle, then settle. It wasn't enough.

cmu-wendigo-lab-seizure = Your muscles lock and your body convulses!
cmu-wendigo-lab-seizure-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} convulses violently!
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-fed = Your body seizes and something settles deep inside you.
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-fed-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} seizes up violently!
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-fed2 = Your body seizes. Your blood runs hot.
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-fed2-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} seizes up, veins standing out beneath the skin!
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-mutagen = Your body seizes. Your veins burn.
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-mutagen-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} convulses as their veins darken beneath the skin!
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-gestation = Your body seizes. Something inside you strains against your skin.
cmu-wendigo-lab-ready-gestation-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} convulses violently, something shifting beneath their skin!
cmu-wendigo-lab-shiver-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} shivers uncontrollably.

cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-1 = You are so hungry. So very hungry.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-2 = Your skin feels stretched too tight across your frame.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-3 = You feel your organs shift and slide inside you.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-4 = Your bones grind and creak as they rearrange themselves.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-5 = Your teeth ache. They feel longer.
cmu-wendigo-lab-gestation-flavor-6 = The smell of the people around you makes your mouth water.

cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-warning-1 = YOUR BODY IS MUTATING!
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-warning-2 = YOUR BONES ARE SPLITTING AND REFORMING!
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-warning-3 = YOUR SKIN IS TEARING OPEN!
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-warning-4 = YOU CAN NO LONGER FEEL WHERE YOU END!
cmu-wendigo-lab-mutation-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} thrashes as their body twists and stretches!

cmu-wendigo-lab-window-closing = Something inside you is starting to fade. It feels like something needs to happen soon.
cmu-wendigo-lab-window-closing-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} sags and pales. Whatever is happening to them is slipping away!
cmu-wendigo-lab-window-missed = Something inside you withers. The change slips back.
cmu-wendigo-lab-window-missed-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))} retches and shudders as the change slips back!

cmu-wendigo-lab-instability = Your flesh crawls and spasms. It feels like something went wrong. (Instability {$level}/{$max})
cmu-wendigo-lab-instability-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))}'s skin ripples unnaturally. Something has gone wrong! (Instability {$level}/{$max})
cmu-wendigo-lab-instability-severe = Your body is tearing itself apart! Something is very wrong. (Instability {$level}/{$max})
cmu-wendigo-lab-instability-severe-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))}'s flesh splits and knits back together. They look dangerously unstable! (Instability {$level}/{$max})
cmu-wendigo-lab-collapse = Your body gives out. The change was too much.
cmu-wendigo-lab-collapse-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))}'s body convulses one last time and collapses!
cmu-wendigo-lab-bond-failed-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($subject))}'s eyes go wild. The conditioning did not take!
